WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You can reach the end of a page without knowing what you just read.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Your eyes kept moving. Your attention had already left.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Researchers call the shift mind wandering.
Noticing the shift is a different event.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
That is why counting every distraction tells only part of the story.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
A quiet twelve-minute baseline can tell you what you actually finish.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Before you pay for a shortcut, look for the evidence behind the promise.
